@startuml
title Vehicle Rental Management System - Use-Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor Renter
actor Customer
actor Admin

rectangle "Vehicle Rental Management System" {
  usecase "Register as renter" as UC_RenterRegister
  usecase "Add vehicle" as UC_AddVehicle
  usecase "Remove vehicle" as UC_RemoveVehicle
  usecase "View all vehicles" as UC_ViewAll
  usecase "View available vehicles" as UC_ViewAvailable

  usecase "Register as customer" as UC_CustomerRegister
  usecase "Book vehicle" as UC_Book
  usecase "View bookings" as UC_Bookings
  usecase "Return vehicle" as UC_Return
  usecase "Calculate standard bill" as UC_StandardBill
  usecase "Calculate discounted bill" as UC_DiscountBill
  usecase "Validate discount percentage" as UC_ValidateDiscount
  usecase "Apply discount" as UC_ApplyDiscount

  usecase "View booked vehicles" as UC_ViewBooked
  usecase "View registered renters" as UC_ViewRenters
  usecase "View registered customers" as UC_ViewCustomers
  usecase "Exit program" as UC_Exit
}

Renter --> UC_RenterRegister
Renter --> UC_AddVehicle
Renter --> UC_RemoveVehicle
Renter --> UC_ViewAll
Renter --> UC_ViewAvailable

Customer --> UC_CustomerRegister
Customer --> UC_ViewAll
Customer --> UC_ViewAvailable
Customer --> UC_Book
Customer --> UC_Bookings
Customer --> UC_Return
Customer --> UC_StandardBill
Customer --> UC_DiscountBill

Admin --> UC_ViewAll
Admin --> UC_ViewAvailable
Admin --> UC_ViewBooked
Admin --> UC_ViewRenters
Admin --> UC_ViewCustomers

UC_DiscountBill ..> UC_StandardBill : <<include>>
UC_DiscountBill ..> UC_ValidateDiscount : <<include>>
UC_DiscountBill ..> UC_ApplyDiscount : <<include>>

Renter --> UC_Exit
Customer --> UC_Exit
Admin --> UC_Exit

note right of UC_Book
  The menu requires rental days > 0.
  The database currently checks that the vehicle ID exists,
  but does not check availability before marking it rented.
end note

note bottom of UC_ViewRenters
  Admin functionality is a menu in main(), not an authenticated
  admin account. Registration and all records are in-memory only.
  The admin menu is read directly with cin in the source.
end note

note bottom of UC_DiscountBill
  Discount percentage must be between 0 and 100 inclusive.
  Missing vehicle or invalid percentage produces no bill.
end note
@enduml
